[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19140.19, "timestamp": "05:19:00", "text": "呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19143.75, "timestamp": "05:19:03", "text": "阿梅达。哦，她又回来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19145.55, "timestamp": "05:19:05", "text": "音乐会。啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19147.47, "timestamp": "05:19:07", "text": "漂亮的手机壳"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19154.708, "timestamp": "05:19:14", "text": "覆盖我的YouTube频道。哦，是的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19157.03, "timestamp": "05:19:17", "text": "也是个骑行好朋友。我看到了那件事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19158.868, "timestamp": "05:19:18", "text": "骑车的朋友在那里。就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19161.11, "timestamp": "05:19:21", "text": "您可以下载离线版本。这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19165.55, "timestamp": "05:19:25", "text": "社区正在努力实现这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19169.868, "timestamp": "05:19:29", "text": "嗯，呃，还有，呃，你管它叫什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19171.628, "timestamp": "05:19:31", "text": "它？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19175.35, "timestamp": "05:19:35", "text": "嗯，他们决定采用第二季。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19177.99, "timestamp": "05:19:37", "text": "如果我没记错的话，那就是我错过的那个赛季。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 19180.217, "timestamp": "05:19:40", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "\"was\" makin it, until the creators were like, nono"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19181.07, "timestamp": "05:19:41", "text": "没错，我就是那时候开始玩 Cycle 的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19184.15, "timestamp": "05:19:44", "text": "池塘。嗯，是的，但我不知道是否"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19186.23, "timestamp": "05:19:46", "text": "他们会开发多人游戏功能，但我不会。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19188.43, "timestamp": "05:19:48", "text": "我不知道我是否能做到"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 19194.545, "timestamp": "05:19:54", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh